  "text": "proprium.nativitas-beatae-mariae-virginis-tractus",
  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “Nativity of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Rejoice, O Virgin Mary: you alone have destroyed all heresies. You believed what the Archangel Gabriel said. While a virgin, you bore God and man, and after giving birth you remained an inviolate virgin. Mother of God, intercede for us." }
